{"id":"H5798","lemma":"עֻזָּא","transliteration":"uzza","sayIt":"uz-ZA","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Uzzah","meaning":"A man living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 2Sa.6.3;\nson of: Abinadab (H0041);\nbrother of: Eleazar (H0499H) and Ahio (H0283); also called Perez-uzzah at 2Sa.6.8;\nAlso named: pe.rets uz.za (פֶּרֶץ עֻזָּא \"Perez-uzzah\" H6560H)\n§ Uzza or Uzzah = \"strength\"\n1) a man slain by Jehovah for touching the sacred ark\n2) a Benjamite of the sons of Ehud\n3) ancestor of a family of temple slaves who returned from exile with Zerubbabel\n4) the garden where kings Manasseh and Amon of Judah were buried","glosses":["uzzah","uzza","against uzzah"],"count":14,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"2sa-6","v":3,"renderings":{"bsb":"Uzzah","kjv":"and Uzzah"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-6","v":6,"renderings":{"bsb":"Uzzah","kjv":"Uzzah"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-6","v":7,"renderings":{"bsb":"against Uzzah","kjv":"against Uzzah"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-6","v":8,"renderings":{"bsb":"against Uzzah","kjv":"upon Uzzah"}},{"chapterId":"2ki-21","v":18,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Uzza","kjv":"of Uzza"}},{"chapterId":"2ki-21","v":26,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Uzza","kjv":"of Uzza"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-6","v":29,"renderings":{"bsb":"Uzzah","kjv":"Uzza"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-8","v":7,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Uzza","kjv":"Uzza"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-13","v":7,"renderings":{"bsb":"with Uzzah","kjv":"and Uzza"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-13","v":9,"renderings":{"bsb":"Uzzah","kjv":"Uzza"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-13","v":10,"renderings":{"bsb":"against Uzzah","kjv":"against Uzza"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-13","v":11,"renderings":{"bsb":"against Uzzah","kjv":"upon Uzza"}},{"chapterId":"ezr-2","v":49,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Uzza","kjv":"of Uzza"}},{"chapterId":"neh-7","v":51,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Uzza","kjv":"of Uzza"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"2 Samuel 6:3","note":"They set God’s ark on a new cart, and brought it out of Abinadab’s house that was on the hill; and Uzzah and Ahio, the sons of Abinadab, drove the new cart.","source":"web"},{"ref":"2 Kings 21:18","note":"Manasseh slept with his fathers, and was buried in the garden of his own house, in the garden of Uzza; and Amon his son reigned in his place.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 6:29","note":"The sons of Merari: Mahli, Libni his son, Shimei his son, Uzzah his son,","source":"web"},{"ref":"Ezra 2:49","note":"the children of Uzza, the children of Paseah, the children of Besai,","source":"web"},{"ref":"Nehemiah 7:51","note":"the children of Gazzam, the children of Uzza, the children of Paseah.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H6560","lemma":"פֶּרֶץ עֻזָּא","transliteration":"perets uzza","gloss":"Perez-uzza"},{"id":"H1588","lemma":"גַּן","transliteration":"gan","gloss":"Garden (of Uzza)"},{"id":"H0041","lemma":"אֲבִינָדָב","transliteration":"avinadav","gloss":"Abinadab"},{"id":"H0164","lemma":"אֵהוּד","transliteration":"ehud","gloss":"Ehud"},{"id":"H0281","lemma":"אֲחִיָּ֫הוּ","transliteration":"achiyyah","gloss":"Ahijah"},{"id":"H0283","lemma":"אַחְיוֹ","transliteration":"achyo","gloss":"Ahio"},{"id":"H0284","lemma":"אֲחִיחֻד","transliteration":"achichud","gloss":"Ahihud"},{"id":"H0499","lemma":"אֶלְעָזָר","transliteration":"elazar","gloss":"Eleazar"}],"senses":[{"id":"H5798B","gloss":"Uzzah","relation":"H5798B ="},{"id":"H5798G","gloss":"(Garden of) Uzza","relation":"H5798G = a Part of"},{"id":"H5798H","gloss":"Uzza","relation":"H5798H ="},{"id":"H5798I","gloss":"Uzza","relation":"H5798I ="}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}